### Configuration: remplacer les valeurs d'authentification par celles de l'environnement PowerShell
@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@gatewayAuth = Basic BASE64_DE_GATEWAY_USERNAME_COLON_GATEWAY_PASSWORD
@booking = http://localhost:8086
@carshare = http://localhost:8084
@key = p2-demo-booking-001

### Recherche fédérée (vérifier les modes RAIL/AIR/CAR)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/search?origin=Casablanca&destination=Rabat&date=2026-11-15
Authorization: {{gatewayAuth}}

### Saga nominale train + avion; copier bookingId de la réponse
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{gatewayAuth}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"segments":[
  {"mode":"TRAIN","offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
  {"mode":"AIR","offerId":"AIR:AIR-RBA-ORY-1200","origin":"Rabat","destination":"Paris","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1}
]}

### Rejouer exactement la requête précédente : même bookingId et aucune nouvelle réservation
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{gatewayAuth}}
Idempotency-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"segments":[
  {"mode":"TRAIN","offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
  {"mode":"AIR","offerId":"AIR:AIR-RBA-ORY-1200","origin":"Rabat","destination":"Paris","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1}
]}

### Dossier après réservation (remplacer {bookingId})
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings/{bookingId}
Authorization: {{gatewayAuth}}

### Échec de hold après un hold acquis: panne métier simulée, trajet non contigu
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/bookings
Authorization: {{gatewayAuth}}
Idempotency-Key: p2-demo-hold-failure
Content-Type: application/json

{"segments":[
  {"mode":"TRAIN","offerId":"RAIL:RAIL-CAS-RAB-0730","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Rabat","date":"2026-11-15","seats":1},
  {"mode":"AIR","offerId":"AIR:AIR-CMN-MAD-1800","origin":"Casablanca","destination":"Madrid","date":"2026-11-15","seats":4}
]}

### Carshare cycle - création puis remplacement manuel du holdId/ref dans les deux requêtes suivantes
POST {{carshare}}/v1/holds
Content-Type: application/json

{"offerId":"CAR:CAR-CAS-RAB-1000","seats":2}

### Confirmation: remplacer {holdId} par l'identifiant reçu
POST {{carshare}}/v1/holds/{holdId}/confirm

### Annulation idempotente: rejouer une deuxième fois sans effet de stock
DELETE {{carshare}}/v1/references/{bookingRef}

### Régression P1
GET http://localhost:8082/v1/offers?origin=Casablanca&destination=Rabat&date=2026-11-15
GET http://localhost:8083/v1/offers?origin=Rabat&destination=Paris&date=2026-11-15
